   "evidence": "The fields and their docstrings at 185-190 are character-identical to 160-163 and 179-180. Unlike the analogous flat bundles upstream of this PR, nothing outside the new file consumes it: grep for `Assumptions` under `code/EpsilonEridani/Particles/Parton/GTMD` returns only Average.lean:184,193,198,205,289. The justification quoted in the section docstring does not transfer \u2014 `TMD/Basic.lean:47-50` states the TMD field set is frozen because `TMD.Reduction` and `Unified.Basic` already take it as a hypothesis, which is not the case for a structure introduced in this diff.",
   "file": "EpsilonEridani/Particles/Parton/GTMD/Average.lean",
   "fix": "Declare it by extension instead of copying: `structure Assumptions (f : VectorTmd Flavor) : Prop extends IsVectorTmdDensity f, Regularity f` \u2014 then `.toIsVectorTmdDensity`/`.toRegularity` replace the two projection lemmas and `assumptions_iff` becomes `\u27e8fun h => \u27e8h.1, h.2\u27e9, fun h => \u27e8h.1, h.2\u27e9\u27e9`. Or drop `Assumptions`, `assumptions_iff` and both projections and give `assumptions_azimuthalAverage` the two hypotheses `(h\u2081 : IsVectorTmdDensity f) (h\u2082 : Regularity f)`, since its body already only uses `isTmdDensity_azimuthalAverage h\u2081` and `regularity_azimuthalAverage h\u2082`.",
   "issue": "`Assumptions` (lines 184-190) duplicates field-for-field `IsVectorTmdDensity.supportX`/`.nonneg` (lines 161,163) and `Regularity.continuousKT` (line 180), all new in this PR, and then needs `Assumptions.isVectorTmdDensity` (193), `Assumptions.regularity` (198) and `assumptions_iff` (204) purely to translate between the copy and the originals.",
   "line": "184"
